vaem:hasAspect
  a rdf:Property ;
  dcterms:description """
The property "vaem:hasAspect" is used to specify the defined traits of a graph. 
<em>Aspect</em> is borrowed from "aspect-oriented" programming, where it is used to separate concerns. 
An ontology may be characterized by this dimension so as to partition features that are orthogonal. 
"""^^rdf:HTML ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.linkedmodel.org/3.0/schema/vaem> ;
  rdfs:label "has aspect " ;
  rdfs:subPropertyOf vaem:hasDimension ;
.
